QuestGuidance.Register("en",125,{
[3969]="700164D9\n1\tFind the fungus-covered mirror\tThe fungus-covered mirror can be found just outside the Chamber of Memory, south-east of Hulwul-nefekh. Thrand believes the acid Ansurr crafted should destroy the fungus covering the mirror.\n2\tClean mirror with the acid\030Collect Small Acid-phial\tThe fungus-covered mirror can be found just outside the Chamber of Memory, south-east of Hulwul-nefekh. Thrand believes the acid Ansurr crafted should destroy the fungus covering the mirror.\n3\tTalk to Thrand at Hulwul-nefekh\tThrand is at Hulwul-nefekh in central Water-works.\n",
[3970]="7002247B\n1\tDefeat darkwater in Glinghant (total: 30)\tDarkwater are within the pools and gardens of Glinghant, beyond the court of Clorhir. You should enter Glinghant and defeat the darkwater that have despoiled its beauty.\n",
[3971]="700372D3\n1\tTalk to Herehasen at Tordag's camp\tHerehasen is at Tordag's camp in the Broadacres, south of Fangorn. You should return to Herehasen and let him know that the Black Huorns will not threaten the Men of Rohan, and Blackthorn the Ent has pledged his allegiance to them.\n",
[3972]="700372D7\n1\tYour carelessness in slaying the Huorns who serve Blackthorn has likely cost the Rohirrim a powerful ally. You should speak with Blackthorn and try to convince him to help.\t\n2\tTalk to Blackthorn\tBlackthorn has chosen to ignore the needs of the Rohirrim, but at least you can assure Herehasen that the shadows of Fangorn will not harm his people. You should speak with Blackthorn before returning to Herehasen.\n3\tTalk to Herehasen at Tordag's camp\tHerehasen is at Tordag's camp in the Broadacres, south of the eaves of Fangorn. Blackthorn sent you back to Herehasen with his refusal to help the Rohirrim.\n",
[3973]="700372DA\n1\tTalk to Herehasen at Tordag's camp\tHerehasen is at Tordag's camp in the Broadacres, south of Fangorn. You should return to Herehasen and let him know that the Black Huorns will not threaten the Men of Rohan, and Blackthorn the Ent has pledged his allegiance to them.\n",
[3974]="70022B3C\n1\tTalk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs\tMincham is at his camp in the Lich Bluffs. You should speak with Mincham when you are prepared, and he will lead you to the entrance of Lhe Colvern.\n2\tTalk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs\tMincham's camp lies in a small grove of trees, north of Drug Haniad. You should return to Mincham and inform him that the ritual has been stopped and that a greater force is behind the raising of the wights in the Lich Bluffs.\n",
[3975]="7004ABA3\n1\tComplete Barad-dûr: Ruins of Darkness\tCandúr can be found in Udûn. You should talk to Candúr.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted Barad-dûr: Ruins of Darkness.\n",
[3976]="700413C8\n1\tSpeak with Borhador\tBorhador can be found in The Crossing-hall. You should speak with Borhador.\n",
[3977]="7002F979\n1\tTalk to Edwulf at the Rohirrim training grounds\tEdwulf can be found at the Rohirrim training grounds, east of Cliving. The camp is a converted farmstead, hidden in a vale of trees north of the road. Reeve Athelward has asked you to speak with Edwulf, the man in charge of instructing his daughter, Ides, in the martial arts.\n",
[3978]="70035902\n1\tTalk to Barallas to hear more of his tale\tBarallas is at Stonecliff with Tithenolf in northern Balewood. Barallas wishes to tell you more of the Ents of the Balewood. You should speak with him to learn more of his tale.\n2\tTalk to Barallas\tBarallas is at Stonecliff with Tithenolf in northern Balewood. Barallas has finished his tale. You should now speak with him and discover if more can be done to aid the Ents.\n",
[3979]="70030C35\n1\tWhistle and try to grab the avanc's attention\tAs Rook's avanc is his steed of sorts, whistling might be a good way to call him. The avanc can be found under Rook to the west of Snowbourn.\n2\tPoke at the avanc\tWhistling didn't prove helpful, so perhaps a more direct approach would work. The avanc can be found under Rook to the west of Snowbourn.\n3\tAttempt to speak to the avanc\tThe avanc can be found under Rook to the west of Snowbourn.\n4\tTalk to Rook\tRook can be found to the west of Snowbourn.\n",
[3980]="70067F7F\n1\tProvide your wager to Othax to enter the daily Dead Pool.\t\n2\tVisit Othax after 24 hours expire\tYou need to return to Othax at Rhakatâb tomorrow to find out if you made the correct choice.\n3\tSpeak with Othax at Rakhatâb\tIt is a new day. Make your way to Othax in Rakhatâb to see if you were correct that the fire-stoker would have a worker's accident.\n4\tWait to see if you won. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n",
[3981]="70067F8E\n1\tTalk to Othax\tProvide your wager to Othax to enter the daily Dead Pool.\n2\tVisit Othax after 24 hours expire\tYou need to return to Othax at Rhakatâb tomorrow to find out if you made the correct choice.\n3\tSpeak with Othax at Rakhatâb\tIt is a new day. Make your way to Othax in Rakhatâb to see if you were correct that the fire-stokers would have a worker's accident.\n4\tWait to see if you won. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n",
[3982]="70067F88\n1\tProvide your wager to Othax to enter the daily Dead Pool.\t\n2\tVisit Othax after 24 hours expire\tYou need to return to Othax at Rhakatâb tomorrow to find out if you made the correct choice.\n3\tSpeak with Othax at Rakhatâb\tIt is a new day. Make your way to Othax in Rakhatâb to see if you were correct that the generalists would have a worker's accident.\n4\tWait to see if you won. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n",
[3983]="70067F8D\n1\tProvide your wager to Othax to enter the daily Dead Pool.\t\n2\tVisit Othax after 24 hours expire\tYou need to return to Othax at Rhakatâb tomorrow to find out if you made the correct choice.\n3\tSpeak with Othax at Rakhatâb\tIt is a new day. Make your way to Othax in Rakhatâb to see if you were correct that the master of workers' charges had a worker's accident.\n4\tWait to see if you won. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n",
[3984]="70067F8B\n1\tProvide your wager to Othax to enter the daily Dead Pool.\t\n2\tVisit Othax after 24 hours expire\tYou need to return to Othax at Rhakatâb tomorrow to find out if you made the correct choice.\n3\tSpeak with Othax at Rakhatâb\tIt is a new day. Make your way to Othax in Rakhatâb to see if you were correct that the safety foreman's workers would have an accident.\n4\tWait to see if you have won. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n",
[3985]="7001C61E\n1\tDefeat wights in Agamaur (total: 8)\tWights can be found throughout Agamaur. Eriac has asked you to help kill the wights within Agamaur. The creatures are too numerous and dangerous for the small band of Eglain to fight alone.\n2\tTalk to Eriac the Strong at the Eglan-camp in Agamaur\tEriac the Strong is at the Eglan-camp in Agamaur. You entered the Red Swamp and destroyed a good number of the wights. Now the time has come to return to the Eriac the Strong and tell him of all you have done.\n",
[3986]="70000CBD\n1\tReturn the Tokens to Eriac\030Collect ancient tokens (total: 10)\tThe Gloomwater are in the eastern reaches of Agamaur. Eriac has asked you to help keep the Gloomwater, creatures formed from the waters of Agamaur, at bay. As evidence of your efforts, he wants you to bring him the ancient tokens of Rhudaur and Arthedain that are caught up into the Gloomwater as they swirl up from the swamp.\n",
[3987]="70014875\n1\tUse the hidden passage near Stíling\tThe hidden passage is just near Stíling in the hall near Gamil Filik. You should enter the hidden passage to sneak behind the goblin camp.\n2\tArm the trap and lure Pukhlor into it\tThe dead-fall trap lies near the goblin-camp at Gamil Filik, south-east of the Deep Descent camp. Stíling has asked you to find the dead-fall trap and arm it, then lure Pukhlor to his death beneath the rocks.\n3\tReturn to Stíling (you may use the hidden passage)\tStíling is at his spot outside of Gamil Filik. You should return to Stíling and let him know of Pukhlor's defeat.\n4\tTalk to Thettmárr at the Deep Descent\tThettmárr is in the Deep Descent camp, north of Gamil Filik. You should return to Thettmárr and tell him of what you saw in the goblin-camp.\n",
[3988]="7006569B\n1\tDiscover the Erui Delta\tRoused from their murky homes by the growing traffic along the Anduin, river avanc have slithered onto the shores of the Erui Delta.\n2\tDefeat avanc at the Erui Delta (total: 10)\tRoused from their murky homes by the growing traffic along the Anduin, river avanc have slithered onto the shores of the Erui Delta.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated many avanc at the Erui Delta.\n",
[3989]="7005A41F\n1\tCollect Orkish arrows (total: 10)\030Defeat Moria overpass-archers (total: 10)\030Destroy bow stands (total: 4)\tArchers can be found on the western overpass above the Cloudyhead Pass. You should defeat archers and relieve them of their weapons.\n2\tReturn to Valdi\tValdi is located in Amdân. Bring the arrows to Valdi.\n",
[3990]="7004A8E2\n1\tTalk to Legolas in Rath Cail\tLegolas can be found atop a small ridge overlooking Rath Cail. You have travelled into Rath Cail with Legolas and should now speak to him.\n",
[3991]="7004117C\n1\tDefeat darkwater in Tarlang's Crown (total: 6)\tDarkwater can be found in and along the river Blackroot in Tarlang's Crown Melril has asked you to quiet the waters of the Blackroot which have been roused by Azruthor in Tarlang's Crown.\n2\tTalk to Melril\tMelril can be found at the northern end of Tarlang's Crown in Blackroot Vale. You have quelled the darkwater and returned it to the river Blackroot. You should now speak to Melril.\n",
[3992]="7004A8EB\n1\tChallenge and defeat Captain Róglarg's warriors in Cirith Ungol (total: 12)\tCaptain Róglarg's warriors can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol. Shíkurz has asked you to test the warriors in Captain Róglarg's garrison. You are to challenge them and fight to the death.\n2\tTalk to Shíkurz in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol\tShíkurz can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol. You have defeated many of Captain Róglarg's Orcs and should now return to Shíkurz.\n",
[3993]="7004BEB2\n1\tSteal food from Fushaum Bal North (total: 6)\tFood can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should steal food from Fushaum Bal North while avoiding the guards. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to the Haradrim Commander\tThe Haradrim Commander can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to the Haradrim Commander.\n",
[3994]="70061BC2\n1\tComplete the quest 'Melee in Bloodhollow'\030Complete the quest 'Morbid Botany'\030Complete the quest 'Securing Water'\tMarget, Deryn, and Murig can be found near the Warg den known as Bloodhollow. Help each of the students with their task.\n2\tTalk to Deryn\tYou have aided each of the scout-warriors in training, and should return to their encampment. Talk to Deryn.\n3\tTalk to Deryn\tYou have aided each of the scout-warriors in training, and should return to their encampment. Talk to Deryn.\n",
[3995]="7006819D\n1\tTalk to Anath\tWhile you were searching for Berkha, Itho arrived to try stealing one of Raghda-gûn's eggs for himself. Speak to Raghda-gûn's friends to discover the story of what transpired.\n2\tTalk to Nekhama in Halrax\tAnath has asked you to meet Nekhama in Halrax.\n",
[3996]="70040002\n1\tIdentify a Spotter\tCall out the spotters so your archers can defeat them.\n",
[3997]="7001D0CA\n1\tTalk to Vatnar to enter the cellars\tVatnar is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz. You should speak with Vatnar when your are ready to travel with him and Thyrnir to prevent the goblin-sappers from destroying Thangúlhad.\n2\tTalk to Vatnar at Thangúlhad\tVatnar is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz. With the aid of Vatnar and Thyrnir, you have defeated the goblin-sappers and saved Thangúlhad. You should speak again with Vatnar.\n",
[3998]="7001B70F\n1\tDrownholt\t\n",
[3999]="7002ED20\n1\tDefeat drakes in the Entwash Vale (total: 8)\tDrakes can be found throughout the Entwash Vale. You should hunt down the drakes of the Entwash Vale, reducing the threat they pose to the people of the Vale.\n",
[4000]="7003FFF0\n1\tSlain animals can be found along the river Blackroot to the south of Alagrant and west of Sardol. Garthwen has asked for aid in clearing the river Blackroot of animals for they shall pollute the river if left to rot.\t\n2\tTalk to Garthwen\tGarthwen can be found in Sardol in south-west Blackroot Vale. You have cleared the remains of many animals from the Blackroot, and should now return to Garthwen.\n",
})
